{"seq":8,"slug":"history","title":"九年级历史","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/history","introMarkdown":"# 九年级历史 简介\n\n九年级历史聚焦近现代世界格局的剧变与当代中国的发展道路，是初中历史学习中视野最为宏阔的阶段。在七年级古代史和八年级近代史的基础上，学生将理解两次世界大战如何重塑国际秩序，认识新中国成立以来的社会主义建设与改革开放历程，并对三年所学进行系统整合。\n\n本内容共包含三个章节。第一章**世界大战与国际秩序**，梳理第一次世界大战的起因与凡尔赛体系、第二次世界大战的关键转折与雅尔塔体系，分析战后冷战格局的形成与两极对峙的深远影响。第二章**当代中国**，聚焦新中国成立后的土地改革、工业化建设、文化大革命的教训以及改革开放的伟大实践，帮助学生理解中国特色社会主义道路的历史逻辑。第三章**历史综合复习**，以时间线与专题并行的方式，串联中外历史的重大事件、关键人物与核心概念，训练史料分析、因果推理和观点论述等中考必备能力。\n\n历史学习要将记忆与理解相结合。建议按照时间轴建立事件之间的因果链条，注重从多角度分析历史事件的影响，善于用史实支撑自己的观点。\n\n本内容适合九年级学生中考复习及近现代史兴趣拓展。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"world-wars","title":"世界大战","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/history/world-wars","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"world-war-two","title":"九年级历史 — 第二次世界大战","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/history/world-wars/world-war-two"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cold-war","title":"九年级历史 — 冷战","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/history/world-wars/cold-war"},{"seq":3,"slug":"post-cold-war","title":"九年级历史 — 冷战后的世界","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/history/world-wars/post-cold-war"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"china-contemporary","title":"当代中国","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/history/china-contemporary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"socialist-construction","title":"九年级历史 — 社会主义建设道路的探索","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/history/china-contemporary/socialist-construction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reform-era","title":"九年级历史 — 改革开放时代","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/history/china-contemporary/reform-era"},{"seq":3,"slug":"china-world-stage","title":"九年级历史 — 中国走向世界舞台","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/history/china-contemporary/china-world-stage"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"history-review","title":"历史复习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/history/history-review","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"timeline-review","title":"九年级历史 — 历史时间线复习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/history/history-review/timeline-review"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cause-effect-analysis","title":"九年级历史 — 因果分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/history/history-review/cause-effect-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"historical-materials","title":"九年级历史 — 史料分析与解题技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/history/history-review/historical-materials"}]}]}